Goal: Accelerate supplier invoice payments while ensuring that invoices do not remain unattended before processing.

  1. Total Cycle Time from Purchase Requisition to Invoice Payment [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)
  2. Invoice Release Waiting Time [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)

